21996_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Eej_1auxy5kQ7kNvwEPgKkr&_nc_oc=AdqUbm_gMPbxsXE38YVRMomgFJ4iO6y9cwVIS1L3qFZjNUM-4M_zNoywC2zDtaePTuI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6z80sQ6w-5iu6QYat2tnsNg99eHp859Myivw53Am5bAg&oe=6A0B2434"}, {"file_name": "ScreenShot 1.png", "id": "1250575196899192", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819281_1250575203565858_6420430271040368029_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ejK6wXr8-EgQ7kNvwF3A-4f&_nc_oc=Adqkv8kpibca7Eno_XLiFVHiY0dY0unnpGUQUo9zcQyKhQvzgqgQZakr1KJMjbaw57s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7Yl-CLNi21v6YffFx8IzjgHraBlwh7m9u2LRgCgVKlyQ&oe=6A0B2445"}, {"file_name": "ScreenShot 4.png", "id": "1582469119428337", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821682_1582469122761670_7722550790995415168_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=usk1gsyMK5oQ7kNvwEhQOqP&_nc_oc=AdpJklEgmvyZU2V4TPSATwgN3s8-fDOaNU0ZTz1sCNkKgzKiz9FVd4oKKz5w43x354w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4GD8_s1zbw6zvQUKIzhvzPsOFSNPaaSdLl9qxEW-05YQ&oe=6A0B1358"}, {"file_name": "ScreenShot 5.png", "id": "1363581454936796", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828104_1363581461603462_676098021424155792_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ErA26SD2ADgQ7kNvwGnGTaP&_nc_oc=Adq5dHgakqSdC0dn_Agx3adyOT-RwUDJlEh8JlplkeF095wceU8QQDKPvs0VEI0fuJI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4A6TufcYf3bYHUXnOyA3VVq2N65G9C_QLzC-LUnWiGBg&oe=6A0B1E3F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Formula X: Grand Prix Car Racing Legends", "keywords": ["Formula", "Racing", "F1", "Sport", "GrandPrix"], "long_description": "Become the leader of the track in Formula X: Grand Prix Car Racing Legends, the ultimate F1 racing simulator built for fans of high-speed F1 racing, Formula car racing, & immersive Grand Prix action. Step into powerful Formula machines where speed, precision, & split-second decisions define every victory in this intense Formula X motorsport experience\n\n# PURE FORMULA 1 & F1 RACING THRILL\nFeel every vibration, acceleration, & sharp corner as you push your Formula car to the limit. Master tight turns, chase the perfect racing line, & execute bold overtakes with smooth VR controls. Dynamic traction & realistic handling create a true Formula racing simulator experience\n\n# SMART AI RIVALS & COMPETITIVE RACING\nRace against intelligent AI opponents that adapt to your driving style, defend aggressively, & force you to think like a real Formula 1 driver. Every race delivers intense competition & nonstop Grand Prix racing excitement\n\n# TRACK AWARENESS SYSTEMS\nStay focused with wrong-way alerts, racing indicators, & clean driving feedback that keep the action immersive & competitive\n\n# CONQUER IMMERSIVE FORMULA X CIRCUITS\nRace across handcrafted F1 tracks with high-speed straights, technical corners, & racing zones. Every circuit delivers stunning visuals & authentic VR driving simulator gameplay.\n\n# DRIVE MULTIPLE F1 RACING CARS\nUnlock high-performance Formula 1 cars with unique acceleration, braking, traction, & handling\n\nhit the asphalt, & chase your legacy in the ultimate Formula X car racing adventure.", "short_description": "Feel the rush of Formula X : Grand Prix car Racing Legends with intense F1 racing, high-speed Grand Prix action, & immersive VR motorsport gameplay. Formula X delivers smooth Formula 1 car control, realistic traction, stunning racing circuits, & competitive AI rivals that push every F1 style racing moment to the limit. Experience VR racing, Formula 1 racing, racing simulator thrills, F1 car racing, & true Formula car adrenaline as you dominate the track in the ultimate VR driving experience."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/gamotronixstudio/privacypolicy-meta", "de